      "post": {
        "text_zh": "午後的陽光剛好落在石板路上，粉色、黃色和薄荷綠的老房子，一路陪我走到街角。☀️\n\n今天沒有趕行程，只是慢慢走、慢慢拍，把喜歡的顏色都收進相機裡。\n\n你最近一次停下來好好看風景，是什麼時候呢？\n\n#晴晴的散步日記 #老街散步 #原創虛構角色",
        "text_en": "The afternoon sun landed right on the cobblestones, and the pink, yellow and mint-green houses walked with me all the way to the corner. ☀️\n\nNo rush today: just slow steps, slow shots, and every favorite color saved in the camera.\n\nWhen did you last stop and really look around?\n\n#QingqingWalks #OldTownStroll #OriginalFictionalCharacter"
      },
      "note_zh": null,
      "note_en": null,
      "disclosure_zh": "這份貼文為預先撰寫的文案範例，展示語氣、段落與標籤。",
