      "post": {
        "text_zh": "這次上到雪山稜線，等了將近一個小時，才等到雲層散開、整排山峰被陽光照亮的那一刻。\n\n分享三個雪地拍攝的小技巧：\n1. 雪景容易讓測光偏暗，曝光補償可以先加 +0.7 到 +1。\n2. 低溫下電池消耗很快，備用電池請貼身保暖。\n3. 構圖時留一點前景，畫面的層次會更明顯。\n\n好的畫面，往往留給願意多等一下的人。\n\n#志遠的山野筆記 #雪山攝影 #原創虛構角色",
        "text_en": "On the snowy ridge this time I waited almost an hour before the clouds opened and the whole line of peaks lit up.\n\nThree tips for shooting in snow:\n1. Snow fools the meter into underexposing, so start at +0.7 to +1 EV.\n2. Batteries drain fast in the cold; keep spares warm in an inner pocket.\n3. Leave some foreground in the frame for depth.\n\nThe best shots go to those who are willing to wait a little longer.\n\n#ZhiyuanFieldNotes #SnowPhotography #OriginalFictionalCharacter"
      },
      "note_zh": null,
      "note_en": null,
